1) DEFINITIONS / DEFINIÇÕES
══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

"Project" means all files in this repository, including (without
limitation) source code, build scripts, configuration files,
documentation, and Assets.

"Assets" means all non-code creative works including (without limitation)
images, sprites, tiles, icons, logos, illustrations, UI elements, audio
(music, sound effects), fonts, maps, level data, translations,
game-design documents, and any other media files. Typically located under
folders such as resource/, assets/, art/, audio/, fonts/, maps/, sounds/.

"Repository" means this specific Git repository and its official hosting
location (e.g., on GitHub).

"Contribution" means any code, documentation, asset, or other material
submitted to this Repository via pull request, patch, or similar
mechanism.

